# Netlify reads this file from the publish directory root and applies these
# headers to matching responses. Expo's static web export copies everything
# in this `public/` folder into `dist/` verbatim (confirmed against Expo
# SDK 54 docs per AGENTS.md), so this ships on every `expo export -p web`.
#
# Scoped to what this app actually loads on the web build:
#   - script-src/style-src 'unsafe-inline': React Native Web injects its
#     atomic CSS as an inline <style> block, and Expo Router bootstraps
#     hydration via an inline <script type="module">. Both are fundamental
#     to how this static export works — there's no server here to mint a
#     per-request nonce, so this is the accepted trade-off for this
#     architecture rather than an oversight.
#   - https://unpkg.com (style-src only): Leaflet's CSS, loaded by
#     app/admin/settings/showroom.tsx for the manager's showroom-location
#     map picker.
#   - https://*.tile.openstreetmap.org (img-src): map tile images for the
#     same picker.
#   - https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org (connect-src): address search in
#     lib/geocode.ts, used by the same showroom-location picker.
#   - the Supabase project URL (connect-src, https + wss): all app data and
#     Realtime subscriptions.
#
# If a future change adds a new external host (a font CDN, an image host,
# etc.), the browser console will show a CSP violation naming exactly which
# directive to extend — don't loosen this wholesale to fix it.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://unpkg.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.tile.openstreetmap.org; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://rznqhxzymttqqoxlbfhu.supabase.co wss://rznqhxzymttqqoxlbfhu.supabase.co https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
